      "body": "Ohms from P10-1 to cabinet ground and P10-3 to ground \u2014 both should be open (no continuity).",
      "sourceExcerpt": "Ohms from P10-1 to cabinet ground and P10-3 to ground \u2014 both should be open (no continuity).",
